WEBVTT

00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:06.360
Ryuuya-dono...

00:00:06.860 --> 00:00:07.820
What?

00:00:10.780 --> 00:00:13.240
I want to ask a favour of you.

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:19.240
It is still a little embarrassing, but...

00:00:19.240 --> 00:00:20.700
...will you watch me?

00:00:22.910 --> 00:00:30.750
We watched the fading contrails go by.

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:34.470
I ran away because it was too bright.

00:00:34.470 --> 00:00:44.690
I let go of your hands because it hurt.

00:00:44.690 --> 00:00:52.070
The place I can't reach is still far away.

00:00:52.480 --> 00:00:59.030
I gaze at it with a wish locked away inside.

00:00:59.030 --> 00:01:07.330
The children walk on the summer railway tracks,

00:01:07.330 --> 00:01:14.010
with hope that will take flight in my hands.

00:01:14.210 --> 00:01:21.930
I chased and chased the fading contrails.

00:01:21.930 --> 00:01:31.190
Nothing changed since the day we went past that hill.

00:01:31.190 --> 00:01:37.740
I hope we can be our honest selves forever,

00:01:37.740 --> 00:01:51.590
and definitely protect this Poseidon-like strength.

00:01:53.920 --> 00:01:54.960
Here goes...

00:01:57.090 --> 00:01:58.300
Wait just one moment!

00:02:01.930 --> 00:02:02.930
What's that?

00:02:02.930 --> 00:02:04.310
Can't you tell?

00:02:04.310 --> 00:02:05.770
They're beanbags.

00:02:05.770 --> 00:02:07.890
What are you planning to do?

00:02:07.890 --> 00:02:10.350
I'm going to juggle!

00:02:10.350 --> 00:02:12.560
I was able to juggle three of them earlier!

00:02:17.030 --> 00:02:19.150
I can tell you're doubtful!

00:02:19.150 --> 00:02:22.320
It's true! I really can juggle three of them!

00:02:22.320 --> 00:02:23.080
Good night.

00:02:23.080 --> 00:02:24.540
Don't go to sleep!

00:02:24.540 --> 00:02:25.990
Go back to bed.

00:02:25.990 --> 00:02:27.290
I'm keeping watch right now.

00:02:27.790 --> 00:02:31.170
Your master is going to show you the skills of an expert!

00:02:31.170 --> 00:02:35.000
It is a subject's duty to prostrate himself and watch in awe!

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:36.210
Now you're just talking crazy!

00:02:36.210 --> 00:02:38.340
Then I order you!

00:02:38.340 --> 00:02:40.050
Hey! Wait, wait, wait!

00:02:40.800 --> 00:02:44.720
Don't order me as my master for something like this! That's cheating!

00:02:44.720 --> 00:02:47.520
I do not want you to give me more of your stupid vows!

00:02:52.600 --> 00:02:53.940
Ow! Don't bite me every single time!

00:02:53.940 --> 00:02:57.440
That is because you manhandle me every single time!

00:03:01.530 --> 00:03:05.950
Fine. I'll watch, so just hurry it up.

00:03:05.950 --> 00:03:08.250
The way you say things is always...!

00:03:08.250 --> 00:03:09.620
All right! All right! I want to watch!
The way you say things is always...!

00:03:09.620 --> 00:03:13.670
I would love to have the honour of seeing it, so just do it!

00:03:13.670 --> 00:03:16.550
As always, your words lack sincerity.

00:03:17.300 --> 00:03:21.630
That aside, I'm sure your attitude will change after you watch me juggle.

00:03:24.390 --> 00:03:26.850
I have finally got the hang of it.

00:03:27.560 --> 00:03:30.680
It was terribly simple once I learned the trick to it.

00:03:30.680 --> 00:03:34.020
I am as good a juggler as Uraha now!

00:03:34.020 --> 00:03:34.810
All right...

00:03:34.810 --> 00:03:40.610
I believe I finally understand how important it is to put one's whole heart into learning something.

00:03:40.610 --> 00:03:41.490
Oh?

00:03:41.490 --> 00:03:42.860
Behold...

00:03:56.130 --> 00:03:58.460
That was an accident.

00:04:16.360 --> 00:04:17.770
I did not lie!

00:04:17.770 --> 00:04:20.190
I really could do it!

00:04:21.530 --> 00:04:23.610
I never said you were lying.

00:04:23.610 --> 00:04:26.200
I'll be watching, so just keep trying.

00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:27.870
I'll do it right this time!

00:04:27.870 --> 00:04:29.490
You should relax.

00:04:29.490 --> 00:04:32.370
Even experts can't do things right when they're nervous.

00:04:32.370 --> 00:04:33.660
I guess so.

00:04:38.290 --> 00:04:39.670
Here goes.

00:04:41.670 --> 00:04:45.010
See?! See?! I did it!

00:04:48.510 --> 00:04:51.350
You did really well.

00:04:51.350 --> 00:04:53.020
I don't need your solace.

00:04:53.020 --> 00:04:57.900
I'm not trying to comfort you. You were able to juggle like that because you tried really hard.

00:04:57.900 --> 00:05:00.570
Not knowing when to give up is amazing.

00:05:00.570 --> 00:05:04.150
I can't tell if you're praising or speaking ill of me.

00:05:04.150 --> 00:05:05.530
I'm praising you.

00:05:06.070 --> 00:05:08.780
In any case, you did well, Kanna.

00:05:08.780 --> 00:05:11.120
I want to get better.

00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:14.330
You'll be an expert as long as you practise every day.

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:15.750
You're exaggerating.

00:05:15.750 --> 00:05:17.170
No, I'm not.

00:05:18.630 --> 00:05:21.800
Will you watch me juggle again?

00:05:22.460 --> 00:05:24.760
Sure. As many times as you want me to.

00:05:25.720 --> 00:05:28.050
Get some sleep while you can.

00:05:28.050 --> 00:05:29.430
We're going to be walking the entire day.

00:05:44.860 --> 00:05:48.110
So we have to go through all of these mountains.

00:05:48.110 --> 00:05:54.080
Passing through the mountains is the best way to avoid our pursuers.

00:05:54.790 --> 00:05:56.870
I am going to fetch some water.

00:06:04.170 --> 00:06:06.210
What's wrong, Kanna?

00:06:17.310 --> 00:06:19.900
Please spare me...

00:06:20.350 --> 00:06:21.770
It won't go in...

00:06:21.770 --> 00:06:24.360
It won't go in, I say...

00:06:24.360 --> 00:06:26.280
Please spare me...

00:06:28.490 --> 00:06:30.280
No more... please...

00:06:31.740 --> 00:06:33.620
I can't eat any more...

00:06:35.740 --> 00:06:39.250
Hey! You'll catch a cold if you sleep like this!

00:06:52.300 --> 00:06:54.600
Hey! Don't fall back asleep!

00:06:58.770 --> 00:07:00.560
Not again!

00:07:00.560 --> 00:07:03.270
Ryuuya-sama. That is not enough.

00:07:14.200 --> 00:07:16.030
That hurt. What was that for?

00:07:16.030 --> 00:07:19.450
Kanna-sama, I am glad to see you in high spirits.

00:07:19.450 --> 00:07:22.460
Do I look like I am in high spirits?

00:07:22.460 --> 00:07:24.960
Can't you wake me a little more gently?

00:07:24.960 --> 00:07:28.510
Then I shall watch my strength next time.

00:07:28.510 --> 00:07:31.930
I'm telling you to stop pulling my pillow away!

00:07:40.520 --> 00:07:43.150
You have strange ears.

00:07:43.150 --> 00:07:46.610
Won't they get caught in the plants when you run?

00:07:46.610 --> 00:07:51.280
With such long ears, I'm sure you can hear things really far away.

00:07:57.200 --> 00:08:00.160
Why, you...! How dare you tease me?!

00:08:00.160 --> 00:08:03.580
Wait! I say wait!

00:08:03.580 --> 00:08:06.080
Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait!

00:08:06.080 --> 00:08:07.040
Be quiet!

00:08:07.040 --> 00:08:08.710
Stay still for a change!

00:08:11.130 --> 00:08:13.300
What were you looking at?

00:08:13.300 --> 00:08:15.720
It's a map I got at the market.

00:08:15.720 --> 00:08:17.800
This was quite a find.

00:08:17.800 --> 00:08:20.850
What's this chicken scratch?

00:08:20.850 --> 00:08:22.270
It's the name of the river.

00:08:22.270 --> 00:08:24.980
You can't read?

00:08:24.980 --> 00:08:26.940
Well, no one taught me.

00:08:26.940 --> 00:08:28.900
Of course I can't read.

00:08:28.900 --> 00:08:30.650
I'm surprised Uraha let that happen.

00:08:31.110 --> 00:08:32.860
I did not.

00:08:32.860 --> 00:08:36.660
Kanna-sama said she did not want to learn from me.

00:08:36.660 --> 00:08:38.160
That is your fault!

00:08:38.580 --> 00:08:43.160
Don't tell me you forgot about that incident with the poem collection.

00:08:43.160 --> 00:08:46.880
I did that in order to enrich your mind.

00:08:46.880 --> 00:08:49.840
There's no way my mind could be enriched with that method of teaching!

00:08:49.840 --> 00:08:51.590
What are you talking about?

00:08:52.010 --> 00:08:56.380
At one time, I was teaching poems to Kanna-sama.

00:08:56.380 --> 00:08:59.470
A little hardship always accompanies learning.

00:08:59.470 --> 00:09:02.100
And yet, Kanna-sama...

00:09:02.100 --> 00:09:06.650
Memorising 100 poems a day is "a little" hardship to you?!

00:09:06.650 --> 00:09:11.070
There is a total of 4500 poems, so we could not take our time!

00:09:12.440 --> 00:09:15.150
I haven't slept in five days...

00:09:16.030 --> 00:09:20.200
Please continue until you memorise 200 more.

00:09:21.490 --> 00:09:23.200
I'm surprised you didn't die.

00:09:23.200 --> 00:09:24.700
That's right.

00:09:24.700 --> 00:09:27.460
I thought I would have been killed at that rate.

00:09:27.460 --> 00:09:30.500
So I threw all the poems into the stove!

00:09:30.500 --> 00:09:35.470
Thanks to that, the six volumes of kokin poems were used as kindling in the preparation of breakfast.

00:09:36.590 --> 00:09:39.930
That morning's meal certainly had a refined taste to it.

00:09:39.970 --> 00:09:44.930
Are those thoughtless words coming from this mouth?!

00:09:44.930 --> 00:09:46.060
T-Thtop it!

00:09:46.060 --> 00:09:49.600
A mouth that cannot recite a single poem is utterly meaningless!

00:09:49.600 --> 00:09:52.150
That ith completely abthurd!

00:09:52.150 --> 00:09:54.400
I might as well sew it shut!

00:09:54.400 --> 00:09:58.820
What are you doing?! Help me!

00:09:58.820 --> 00:10:02.200
Hey, I'm scared of Uraha, too.

00:10:02.200 --> 00:10:04.700
You worthleth fool!

00:10:07.160 --> 00:10:10.540
I am terribly sorry! I lost a bit of self control!

00:10:10.540 --> 00:10:12.290
Don't worry about it.

00:10:12.290 --> 00:10:14.210
Why are you the one excuthing her?

00:10:14.210 --> 00:10:15.670
You're still talking funny.

00:10:16.590 --> 00:10:17.630
I've had enough!

00:10:18.340 --> 00:10:20.890
I'm going to practise juggling over there.

00:10:20.890 --> 00:10:23.220
I'm starting to go crazy over here.

00:10:23.220 --> 00:10:26.060
Then I shall come with you!

00:10:26.060 --> 00:10:28.310
No you will not!

00:10:32.310 --> 00:10:34.230
Why are you hitting me?

00:10:34.230 --> 00:10:36.530
I am taking it out on you!

00:10:42.490 --> 00:10:44.240
What happened, Kanna?

00:11:00.340 --> 00:11:01.970
A monk...

00:11:01.970 --> 00:11:03.720
I don't see any wounds.

00:11:03.720 --> 00:11:06.390
He probably died from emaciation.

00:11:21.030 --> 00:11:22.280
Ryuuya-dono.

00:11:24.280 --> 00:11:25.870
Do you have a moment?

00:11:26.280 --> 00:11:28.750
What? The beanbags again?

00:11:28.750 --> 00:11:30.330
No.

00:11:30.330 --> 00:11:34.330
Is something bothering you?

00:11:35.250 --> 00:11:36.460
What do you mean?

00:11:36.460 --> 00:11:37.550
Yes...

00:11:37.550 --> 00:11:41.300
If there's something you want to say, just come right out and say it.

00:11:41.300 --> 00:11:43.260
What I want to say...

00:11:46.180 --> 00:11:48.260
Then let me say one thing.

00:11:48.260 --> 00:11:49.520
What is it?

00:11:50.020 --> 00:11:51.850
There's a caterpillar on your head.

00:11:55.730 --> 00:11:59.980
Animals and bugs really seem to like you.

00:11:59.980 --> 00:12:02.610
Don't just sit there! Help me!

00:12:02.610 --> 00:12:06.530
I thought you looked unwell.

00:12:06.530 --> 00:12:08.990
Your master asked because she was concerned about her subject.

00:12:08.990 --> 00:12:10.700
What does that leave me with if you are like this?

00:12:11.580 --> 00:12:12.710
Sorry.

00:12:12.710 --> 00:12:14.540
I'll tell you, so just stay here.

00:12:15.460 --> 00:12:18.000
You're not going to tease me again, are you?

00:12:18.000 --> 00:12:19.590
It's not going to be an interesting story, though.

00:12:19.590 --> 00:12:21.130
Are you sure you want to hear it?

00:12:21.130 --> 00:12:22.670
Go ahead.

00:12:25.260 --> 00:12:27.300
I've never seen my parents' faces.

00:12:27.300 --> 00:12:29.470
Why is that?

00:12:29.970 --> 00:12:32.140
I was probably abandoned.

00:12:32.140 --> 00:12:36.190
An unsui took me in when he saw me crying by the road.

00:12:36.190 --> 00:12:38.940
An unsui is a monk who travels around the country.

00:12:40.820 --> 00:12:43.450
Sure, being called an itinerant monk might sound good...

00:12:43.450 --> 00:12:47.240
...but they wander around without lodging and survive off charity.

00:12:48.830 --> 00:12:51.620
We went everywhere together.

00:12:52.370 --> 00:12:56.080
To the north, the south, the east, the west.

00:12:57.670 --> 00:13:00.300
So he was your foster parent?

00:13:00.300 --> 00:13:02.710
I don't know if I could even call him that.

00:13:02.710 --> 00:13:08.550
He was really strict, and he never opened his mouth when he wasn't reciting sutras.

00:13:08.550 --> 00:13:11.310
He never told me his monk name.
[Note: Monks are given names according to the temple in which they are initiated.]

00:13:13.680 --> 00:13:16.060
It was during the summer when I was about five.

00:13:21.190 --> 00:13:23.440
Some bandits attacked us in a mountain pass.

00:13:23.440 --> 00:13:25.820
The unsui was killed by a single sword slash.

00:13:27.280 --> 00:13:31.280
Looking at that dead monk back there reminded me of him.

00:13:32.870 --> 00:13:35.710
So you didn't have a mother, either.

00:13:35.710 --> 00:13:36.660
What?

00:13:37.080 --> 00:13:41.630
I don't know if it's right for me to search only for my mother.

00:13:42.500 --> 00:13:43.710
Don't worry about it.

00:13:43.710 --> 00:13:45.590
This is what I want, too.

00:13:48.470 --> 00:13:51.550
The unsui was praying even after he was cut.

00:13:52.100 --> 00:13:55.520
He prayed that even the ones who killed him would be able to make it to Paradise.

00:13:56.270 --> 00:14:00.020
Then he died, covered in blood.

00:14:00.730 --> 00:14:03.020
I wasn't killed.

00:14:03.530 --> 00:14:06.490
The bandits said I wasn't even worth killing.

00:14:07.400 --> 00:14:10.820
And then I was alone again.

00:14:15.870 --> 00:14:18.370
I was alone ever since then.

00:14:19.210 --> 00:14:21.670
I did anything to live.

00:14:22.210 --> 00:14:25.090
I stole swords and spears, and joined the ranks in wars.

00:14:25.090 --> 00:14:26.880
I even killed people.

00:14:26.880 --> 00:14:30.220
I did everything in my power just to survive.

00:14:31.930 --> 00:14:33.510
Until recently.

00:14:33.510 --> 00:14:35.680
Recently? What happened recently?

00:14:38.390 --> 00:14:40.850
You can call it a change of heart.

00:14:40.850 --> 00:14:43.730
Anyone can change as long as they have the opportunity.

00:14:45.440 --> 00:14:48.700
Those bandits must have regretted it deeply.

00:14:48.700 --> 00:14:49.700
What?

00:14:49.700 --> 00:14:54.700
They killed a great monk. Of course they'd regret it.

00:14:54.700 --> 00:14:58.120
I really doubt that he was a great monk.

00:14:58.120 --> 00:15:00.160
What is there to doubt?

00:15:00.160 --> 00:15:06.630
The bandits didn't kill you because his prayers were answered.

00:15:13.300 --> 00:15:14.600
I see.

00:15:15.350 --> 00:15:19.140
Maybe the unsui did save me then.

00:15:20.180 --> 00:15:23.100
If only I had realised it sooner.

00:15:23.100 --> 00:15:25.860
I may have gone down a different path in life.

00:15:25.860 --> 00:15:27.280
I wouldn't want that!

00:15:27.780 --> 00:15:30.780
Then I would never have met you.

00:15:30.780 --> 00:15:32.530
I guess so.

00:15:32.530 --> 00:15:35.240
I'm also glad I met you.

00:15:37.410 --> 00:15:38.830
Ryuuya-dono...

00:15:41.960 --> 00:15:43.370
Ryuuya-dono...

00:15:44.130 --> 00:15:46.130
Um...

00:15:46.130 --> 00:15:47.380
I...

00:15:47.380 --> 00:15:48.760
What?

00:15:48.760 --> 00:15:52.260
I'm not sure what to do next.

00:15:54.470 --> 00:15:58.930
So, I'll leave the rest to you.

00:15:58.930 --> 00:15:59.970
H-Hey!

00:16:09.230 --> 00:16:12.240
It's embarrassing. Hurry up!

00:16:12.240 --> 00:16:17.330
Hey, do you know what I'm going to do to you?

00:16:17.330 --> 00:16:21.200
Don't take me for a fool. Of course I know.

00:16:21.200 --> 00:16:23.750
I heard from Uraha.

00:16:23.750 --> 00:16:25.960
I knew she put you up to this.

00:16:25.960 --> 00:16:29.920
To me, you are...

00:16:29.920 --> 00:16:31.420
I don't know how to say this.

00:16:32.090 --> 00:16:33.880
It's like...

00:16:36.720 --> 00:16:43.810
Uraha told me that when you talk about your past, I shouldn't miss the opportunity.

00:16:44.230 --> 00:16:49.820
All men will tell the woman they love about their past.

00:16:49.820 --> 00:16:51.900
...is what she said.

00:16:52.490 --> 00:16:54.070
She read me like a book.

00:16:54.490 --> 00:16:59.280
And when he finishes talking, I am to slowly undress.

00:16:59.280 --> 00:17:03.540
And it is important to be sure that not all my chest is visible.

00:17:04.040 --> 00:17:06.500
She's an acting coach, too...

00:17:06.500 --> 00:17:09.540
Did I do something wrong?

00:17:11.000 --> 00:17:14.380
Do you prefer men instead?!

00:17:14.380 --> 00:17:15.720
Wait just a moment.

00:17:15.720 --> 00:17:17.140
Oh, I know.

00:17:17.140 --> 00:17:20.350
I heard there are some men who like women, but are impotent.

00:17:20.970 --> 00:17:23.350
Don't say things like that!

00:17:23.850 --> 00:17:26.350
Did I bare too much of my chest?

00:17:26.940 --> 00:17:28.020
All right.

00:17:29.400 --> 00:17:33.070
Prepare yourself. I'll show you that I'm a man.

00:17:33.070 --> 00:17:36.570
Ryuuya-dono, you have a weird look in your eye.

00:17:36.570 --> 00:17:38.570
You're the one seducing me.

00:17:38.570 --> 00:17:40.530
Be quiet and let me sink my venomous fangs into you.

00:17:40.530 --> 00:17:43.330
You have venom?

00:17:43.330 --> 00:17:45.200
All men do.

00:17:45.200 --> 00:17:48.540
They also have a lot of things you don't know about.

00:17:49.670 --> 00:17:52.800
I'll show you everything you need to know.

00:17:52.800 --> 00:17:54.880
H-Hey! Stop!

00:17:54.880 --> 00:17:55.760
Stop!

00:17:55.760 --> 00:17:58.720
S-Stop! Stop!

00:17:59.300 --> 00:18:02.220
Uraha! I know you're hiding somewhere over there.

00:18:02.220 --> 00:18:03.310
Get out here!

00:18:04.680 --> 00:18:08.230
As usual, you are quite perceptive.

00:18:13.610 --> 00:18:16.490
Are you all right, Kanna-sama?

00:18:16.490 --> 00:18:19.990
I don't really know, but I think it didn't work out right.

00:18:19.990 --> 00:18:21.240
Ryuuya-dono...

00:18:22.830 --> 00:18:26.290
Did I make you mad?

00:18:26.290 --> 00:18:28.040
I'm not mad.

00:18:32.000 --> 00:18:36.300
Uraha, you knew I wasn't going to touch her, didn't you?

00:18:36.300 --> 00:18:38.970
The odds were against me on this particular gamble, though.

00:18:38.970 --> 00:18:41.760
There's no other man more harmless than me.

00:18:41.760 --> 00:18:44.010
You can be called "impotent" as well.

00:18:44.010 --> 00:18:45.260
Shut up!

00:18:52.810 --> 00:18:54.400
She's sleeping well.

00:18:55.070 --> 00:18:59.360
She was practising with her beanbags quite a bit today...

00:18:59.360 --> 00:19:03.740
She does have a pretty adorable face when she's like this.

00:19:03.740 --> 00:19:08.620
I wanted to teach her the wiles of love before some strange men start making advances at her.

00:19:08.620 --> 00:19:10.330
And you used me for practice?

00:19:10.870 --> 00:19:12.790
She's still a kid.

00:19:12.790 --> 00:19:16.300
She's never even played with dolls or beanbags before.

00:19:19.050 --> 00:19:20.260
Mother...

00:19:21.340 --> 00:19:23.550
Are you awake?

00:19:25.810 --> 00:19:27.770
I was dreaming.

00:19:27.770 --> 00:19:31.480
It was a dream of another place.

00:19:31.480 --> 00:19:35.940
I was wearing strange clothes, and I was different in shape and form.

00:19:37.530 --> 00:19:39.740
Was that me?

00:19:40.240 --> 00:19:42.410
What did you look like?

00:19:42.410 --> 00:19:44.200
I don't remember.

00:19:44.200 --> 00:19:47.290
But Mother was beside me.

00:19:47.290 --> 00:19:49.700
And kind people were beside me.

00:19:50.160 --> 00:19:53.620
I was happy.

00:19:54.170 --> 00:19:57.250
That is a nice dream.

00:19:57.250 --> 00:19:59.630
Just make that dream a reality.

00:20:00.130 --> 00:20:02.930
You'll see your mother soon.

00:20:02.930 --> 00:20:05.430
Then that dream won't be a dream anymore.

00:20:05.430 --> 00:20:07.100
You're right...

00:20:07.100 --> 00:20:11.520
Wishes will be answered as long as I pray for them...

00:20:23.570 --> 00:20:26.660
Look! Look! I can do it!

00:20:27.070 --> 00:20:30.620
They're still going! They're still going!

00:20:46.890 --> 00:20:49.720
You just need a little more practice.

00:20:49.720 --> 00:20:53.520
But it was splendid, Kanna-sama.

00:20:53.520 --> 00:20:58.020
If you keep practising a little more, you will be even better!

00:20:58.020 --> 00:20:59.400
Really?

00:20:59.400 --> 00:21:02.900
Will I be good enough to show it proudly to Mother?

00:21:02.900 --> 00:21:04.200
Of course!

00:21:15.460 --> 00:21:17.290
It's time to go, Kanna.

00:21:18.710 --> 00:21:21.500
What's wrong? Won't you come with us?

00:21:33.220 --> 00:21:35.690
Is that your mother?

00:21:36.480 --> 00:21:37.980
Isn't that nice...

00:21:44.780 --> 00:21:48.410
Live happily for the rest of your life.

00:22:17.690 --> 00:22:27.320
Trying to catch the white fragments of his dream,

00:22:28.400 --> 00:22:33.120
a boy runs.

00:22:33.120 --> 00:22:36.950
When he lets go,

00:22:36.950 --> 00:22:47.840
it disappears into the sound of the wind in the distance.

00:22:47.840 --> 00:22:55.930
The kindness that he once saw is now gone.

00:22:55.930 --> 00:23:06.860
He steps forward alone, looking only at his feet.

00:23:06.900 --> 00:23:22.250
He always listened to the song that disappeared by morning.

00:23:22.250 --> 00:23:37.520
He chased forever those footprints we left.
